# Lotuslight Dancers: Abrupt Decay is black and green, and counts as one card only. Taking it as the black card, Bot1 still finds Giant Growth as the
# green card and Ancestral Recall as the blue card (the ruling). Dark Ritual, Giant Growth and Abrupt Decay together are refused, as there
# is no blue card among them and only two of the three colors to share out: Dark Ritual and Abrupt Decay both need black or green, and so does Giant Growth.
# Dark Ritual stays in the library.

